creatures:
- name: Sphinx of Wonder
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 13  
      **Hit Points** 24 (rollable(dice=7d4 + 7,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 20 ft., Fly 40 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=15)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=13)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Arcana rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Arcana Check), Religion rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Religion Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** necrotic, psychic, radiant  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 11  
      **Languages** Celestial, Common  
      **Challenge** 1 (200 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Magic Resistance.*** The sphinx has ***Advantage*** on saving throws against spells and other magical effects.

      ## Actions

      ***Rend.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Rend]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+3,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Rend]) Radiant damage.

      ## Reactions

      ***Burst of Ingenuity (2/Day).*** *Trigger:* The sphinx or another creature within 30 feet makes an ability check or a saving throw. *Response:* The sphinx adds 2 to the roll.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Tiny Celestial, Lawful Good*  
